omplete at 10 hours a week\" (a different pace scenario), the FAQ directly addresses the 3–5 hours/week scenario with 16 weeks, making the response's answer accurate and well-sourced for the specific 5 hours/week condition asked in the task.\n\nAll five task components are satisfied with screenshot evidence.\n\n## Verdict\n**SUCCESS**",
